{"ID":"20240513082938-u27i75q","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513082938-u27i75q","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513082938-u27i75q\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513180429-8ranr74\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513180429-8ranr74\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:128,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513180429-8ranr74\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:324,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:333\u0026#125;","title":"356","type":"doc","updated":"20240515114329"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513180429-8ranr74","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 906px;","id":"20240513180429-8ranr74","updated":"20240515114329"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期："}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"248-1 Y, C"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"男"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中等"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"20080514"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"C肝"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服HT-45(己椒歷黃丸)後,大便三次,下利多,二次後,左小腹痛"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 服藥後這幾天都4:30AM醒來"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 有三天早上飯後立刻排軟便"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. 頭昏好轉,但左腹有粗索狀硬塊"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4. 小便淡黃,泡沫仍多"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5. 中餐後感覺食物進入腸道,腸鳴聲仍有"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6. 雙足較熱"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7. 很少運動,無太多汗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈緩有力"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苔淡黃紅"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診：\n3."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 手溫額熱"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 裡濕熱仍有"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.HT-45己椒藶黃丸 80粒 每次40粒用一錢芒硝沖服，隔日再服"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.同5/7 去炮附子  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"柒付  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"九碗煮三碗  bf B/S"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.夜間2:00AM, 4:00AM醒來"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→病走陽,不嚴重 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"若為1:00AM, 3:00AM醒來"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→病走陰,可能有陰實"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.病人中餐飯後腸鳴"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→中午為胃氣最強時,腸鳴表示胃氣仍未恢復"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.上次藥後之腸胃道症狀是因攻堅,排毒故"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→中病"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}